{"unit_id":"shangshuo__dsh-sync#card-zh","repo":"shangshuo/dsh-sync","commit":"9adce6042839758745aa309832261f42c7237ad9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Sync 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 配置备份与恢复插件。它在 DSH 中注册 Agent 工具，并提供设置页，可把所选配置模块收集成归档，以口令加密后保存到 S3 兼容存储、WebDAV 或本地目录。用户可以查看状态、配置命名同步档案、测试连接、立即备份、列出快照并预览或恢复；也可启用定时同步。适合迁移 DSH 配置或保留可恢复备份的用户。需要配置一个存储目标和加密口令；S3、WebDAV 凭据按所选目标填写。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1","lib/tools.js:27","lib/engine.js:1","client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"shangshuo__dsh-sync#card-en","repo":"shangshuo/dsh-sync","commit":"9adce6042839758745aa309832261f42c7237ad9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Sync backs up selected DSH profile modules to S3-compatible storage, WebDAV, or a local folder. Agent tools and a settings page configure targets, test connections, encrypt and schedule backups, list snapshots, and preview or restore them. Requires a storage target and archive passphrase.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1","lib/tools.js:27","lib/engine.js:1","client.js:1"]}
